{%- comment -%}
  Classifies an image for a square frame. Outputs `is-fit` when the image is not (near) square,
  so it is shown whole (contain) over a blurred copy of itself instead of being cropped or boxed.
  Usage: {%- capture fitc -%}{% render 'fit', img: image %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if img -%}{%- assign r = img.aspect_ratio | default: 1 | times: 1.0 -%}{%- if r < 0.92 or r > 1.08 -%}is-fit{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
